{"id": "16-2098-2-5", "zh": "dhivu、khivu：义为显示。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-2098-6-7", "zh": "dhibbati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2098-8-9", "zh": "khibbati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2099-2-4", "zh": "sā：义为削薄。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2099-5-8", "zh": "siyati、siyanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2100-2-4", "zh": "sā：义为终结。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2100-5-15", "zh": "siyati。因为它无余地断除（siyati）、彻底根除我慢，所以最上道被称为 mānasa——确实是这样说过的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2101-2-4", "zh": "sā：义为品尝。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2101-5-7", "zh": "rasaṃ sāyati（品尝味道）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2101-8-11", "zh": "sāyitaṃ、sāyanaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2102-2-4", "zh": "si：义为生育后代。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2102-5-8", "zh": "sūyati、pasūyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2102-9-11", "zh": "pasūtā gāvī（已经生产的母牛）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2103-2-4", "zh": "kusu：义为取走与照亮。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2103-5-6", "zh": "kusayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2104-2-4", "zh": "silisa：义为拥抱。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2104-5-6", "zh": "silissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2104-7-8", "zh": "sileso。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2105-2-4", "zh": "kilisa：义为折磨。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2105-5-8", "zh": "kilissati、saṃkilissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2105-9-12", "zh": "kileso、saṃkileso。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2105-13-19", "zh": "省去 i 音时，就有 klissati、kleso 等形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2105-20-28", "zh": "另外，污秽的意思也用 kilisa 这个词来表达，例如 kiliṭṭhavatthaṃ paridahati（穿上脏污的衣服）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2105-29-41", "zh": "在“Cittena saṃkiliṭṭhena, saṃkilissanti māṇavā”（心受污染，人们就受污染）等句子中也是这样，因为词根有多种意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2106-2-5", "zh": "masa：义为变少与忍耐。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2106-6-7", "zh": "massati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2107-2-4", "zh": "līsa：义为变少。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2107-5-6", "zh": "lissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2107-7-8", "zh": "leso（少许）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2107-9-18", "zh": "老师们也读作“lisa：义为 lesana”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2108-2-4", "zh": "tasa：义为渴。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2108-5-8", "zh": "tassati、paritassati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2108-9-14", "zh": "paritassanā、tasiṇā、tasito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2109-2-4", "zh": "dusa：义为变坏。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2109-5-6", "zh": "dussati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2109-7-12", "zh": "doso、dosanaṃ、dosito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2110-2-4", "zh": "dusa：义为不喜。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2110-5-8", "zh": "dussati、padussati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2110-9-22", "zh": "doso、padoso、duṭṭho、paduṭṭho、dūsako、dūsito、dūsanā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2111-2-4", "zh": "asu：义为投掷。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2111-5-7", "zh": "khepo 就是 khipanaṃ（投掷）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2111-8-9", "zh": "assati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2111-10-13", "zh": "nirassati、ādiyati ca dhammaṃ（抛弃法，又执取法）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2111-14-15", "zh": "issāso。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2112-2-10", "zh": "这里，**nirassati** 的意思是抛弃导师，同样也抛弃对法的宣说等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2112-11-19", "zh": "**Issāso** 的意思是：投掷（assati）、射出箭（usuṃ）的人，所以叫 issāso，就是弓箭手。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2113-2-4", "zh": "yasu：义为努力。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2113-5-6", "zh": "yassati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2113-7-8", "zh": "niyasakammaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2114-2-22", "zh": "这里，通过某种律的羯磨，使愚人被责令“你必须依止而住”，让他去亲近依止的人，所以叫 niyasa，这就叫作 niyasakamma（依止羯磨）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2114-23-37", "zh": "而在“Karohi me yakkha niyasakamman”（夜叉啊，请惩治我吧）这句里，niyasakamma 指的是惩治的行为。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2115-2-4", "zh": "bhassa：义为说话。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2115-5-6", "zh": "bhassati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2115-7-10", "zh": "bhassaṃ、bhassakārako（说话的人）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2116-2-4", "zh": "vasa：义为发声。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2116-5-7", "zh": "sakuṇo vassati（鸟鸣叫）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2116-8-14", "zh": "孩子啊，兽类中最低劣的豺在嚎叫。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2116-15-17", "zh": "maṇḍūko vassati（青蛙鸣叫）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2117-2-5", "zh": "nasa：义为不见，即消失。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2117-6-8", "zh": "nassanadhammaṃ nassati（会坏灭的东西坏灭）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2117-9-10", "zh": "panassati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2117-11-12", "zh": "vinassati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2117-13-19", "zh": "Nassa vasali, cara pire vinassa（滚开，贱女人！走开，外人，消失吧！）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2117-20-23", "zh": "naṭṭho、vinaṭṭho。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2117-24-29", "zh": "使役形：nāseti、nāsayati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2118-2-4", "zh": "susa：义为干燥。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2118-5-7", "zh": "paṇṇaṃ sussati（叶子干枯）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2118-8-15", "zh": "使役形：vāto paṇṇaṃ soseti、sosayati（风使叶子干枯）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2118-16-21", "zh": "被动形：vātena paṇṇaṃ sosiyati（叶子被风吹干）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2118-22-24", "zh": "无人称语态的动词形式不常见。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2118-25-29", "zh": "soso；sukkhaṃ kaṭṭhaṃ（干燥的木柴）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2118-30-33", "zh": "sussaṃ、sussanto。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2118-34-36", "zh": "sussamāno dahado（正在干涸的湖）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2119-2-4", "zh": "tusa：义为满足。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2119-5-8", "zh": "tussati、santussati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2119-9-20", "zh": "santuṭṭhi、santoso、tosanaṃ、tuṭṭhabbaṃ、tussitabbaṃ、tusitā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2119-21-28", "zh": "使役形有“toseti”等。", "confidence": 85}
